'''The Wasteland''' is an area on the [[Crimson Isle]] behind the {{zone|Blazing Volcano}}.

{{ZoneText|Look up.}}

== Purpose ==
The location is a barren expanse of [[Netherrack]]. There is an entrance leading off to the {{zone|Smoldering Tomb}}, and there is a path leading to {{zone|Scarleton}}. [[Dive Ghast]]s spawn in the air above {{zone|The Wasteland}}.

